@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container my-5">
    <h1 class="mb-4">Privacy & Policy</h1>

    <p>
        This Privacy Policy describes how <strong>Oak & Origin</strong> (“we”, “us”, “our”) collects, uses, stores, and protects
        information about users (“you”, “your”) of our website located at OakandOrigin.com (the “Website”).
    </p>

    <h4>1. Consent</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>By using this Website, you consent to the collection and use of your Personal Information as outlined here.</li>
        <li>You may withdraw consent at any time, but certain features of the Website may not work without it.</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>2. Definition of Information</h4>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Personal Information:</strong> Data that identifies you (name, email, address, phone number, payment info, etc.).</li>
        <li><strong>Non-Personal Information:</strong> Anonymous data like IP address, browser type, location, and site usage patterns.</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>3. Information We Collect</h4>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Registration:</strong> When you create an account, we collect your name, email, password, and contact details.</li>
        <li><strong>Purchases:</strong> When placing an order, we may collect billing/shipping addresses, phone number, and payment details (processed securely).</li>
        <li><strong>Communications:</strong> Information you provide via email, contact forms, reviews, or surveys.</li>
        <li><strong>Marketing:</strong> If you subscribe, we collect your email for promotional updates. You may unsubscribe anytime.</li>
        <li><strong>Cookies & Logs:</strong> We use cookies to remember your preferences, enhance experience, and analyze traffic.</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>4. How We Use Your Information</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>To process and deliver your orders.</li>
        <li>To provide customer support and respond to inquiries.</li>
        <li>To personalize your shopping experience.</li>
        <li>To improve our products, services, and website functionality.</li>
        <li>To send order confirmations, updates, and marketing communications (if opted in).</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>5. Sharing of Information</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>We do not sell your personal data.</li>
        <li>
            We may share necessary information with:
            <ul>
                <li>Payment processors (for secure transactions).</li>
                <li>Shipping providers (to deliver your orders).</li>
                <li>Service providers for hosting, analytics, or marketing support.</li>
            </ul>
        </li>
        <li>We may disclose information if required by law or legal process.</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>6. Security</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>We use industry-standard SSL encryption for payment data.</li>
        <li>Access to personal data is restricted to authorized staff only.</li>
        <li>Despite safeguards, no system is 100% secure; use the Website at your own risk.</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>7. Retention of Data</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>We keep your personal data only as long as necessary to fulfill the purpose for which it was collected.</li>
        <li>Some information may be retained for legal, security, or fraud-prevention purposes.</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>8. Your Rights</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>You may request access to the data we hold about you.</li>
        <li>You may correct or update your personal details.</li>
        <li>You may request deletion of your personal data (unless required by law to retain).</li>
        <li>You may opt out of marketing communications at any time.</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>9. Cookies & Tracking</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>We use cookies to enhance user experience and remember preferences.</li>
        <li>You may disable cookies in your browser, but some features may not work properly.</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>10. Children’s Privacy</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>Our Website is not directed to children under 13.</li>
        <li>We do not knowingly collect personal data from minors.</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>11. Policy Updates</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>We may revise this Privacy Policy from time to time.</li>
        <li>Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>12. Contact Us</h4>
    <p>
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how your data is handled, please contact us at:
        <a href="mailto:support@oakandorigin.com">support@oak&origin.com</a> 
    </p>
</div>
